{
  "about": "Which model answers each task. Spec = provider:model. Override any task with an environment variable AI_MODEL_<TASK> (CHAT, ANSWER_CHECK, QUERY_REWRITE, TEMPLATE_PICK, DRAFTING, REVIEW, RERUN), for example AI_MODEL_CHAT=anthropic:claude-haiku-5-5. Providers: gemini (GEMINI_API_KEY), anthropic (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY), litellm (LITELLM_BASE_URL + LITELLM_API_KEY, any OpenAI-compatible endpoint). thinking: off | minimal | low | medium | high. firstTokenMs: give up on a model that has produced no text by then (0 = never) and use the fallback; fallback: tried in order when a model is busy or unavailable (override with AI_FALLBACK_<TASK>, comma-separated, empty = none). See docs/PAID-SWITCHOVER.md.",
  "tasks": {
    "chat": {
      "model": "gemini:gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
      "thinking": "off",
      "temperature": 0.2,
      "maxOutputTokens": 2500,
      "timeoutMs": 45000,
      "fallback": [
        "gemini:gemini-3.6-flash"
      ],
      "firstTokenMs": 12000
    },
    "answerCheck": {
